 "brief": "Fair distribution and oversight of humanitarian assistance represents a collective responsibility to protect displaced persons' rights, according to Shehab Wire. The destruction of homes and displacement of families in Gaza camps constitute a deep wound to human dignity, imposing on all people of conscience to reflect on what human dignity means when people are stripped of their homes and shelter.\n\nAccountability mechanisms in aid delivery are necessary to ensure vulnerable displaced populations receive adequate support and that resources reach those in need.",
